This repository contains two kinds of material under different terms.

  1. Textbook content: all rights reserved (Part A).
  2. Source code: MIT License (Part B).

The textbook content is:

  - the book files src/content/b*.ts, including all prose, formulas,
    predictions (gate questions, choices, hints, explanations), exercises,
    and glossary entries;
  - everything in src/scenes/ (the interactive figures and their text);
  - everything in docs/.

Everything else in this repository is source code, including the markup
parser and schema in src/content/ (markup.ts, schema.ts, index.ts,
katex-macros.ts), src/verify/, src/la/, src/render/, src/app/, src/sync/,
src/ui/, and scripts/.


